This <University of Oxford> Part B paper covers Logic in section A and <Set> Theory in section B, and is cross-listed for Mathematics, Mathematics and Computer Science, and Mathematics and Philosophy. https://www.whatdotheyknow.com/request/maths_past_papers_3[Source release]{ref} Bounded searches of official sources found no advertised answers for this exact paper. The archive contains a complete editable transcription of all four pages.

